Gladys Outlook Calendar integration
Copyright 2026 William-De71

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

It reads the Outlook calendars of the users of a Gladys Assistant instance
through Microsoft Graph (https://graph.microsoft.com), read-only, with the
Microsoft account each user links and the app registration of the
administrator, and publishes them to Gladys.

